@startuml activity_pemilihan_supplier
title Activity Diagram - Alur Pemilihan Supplier (UC-02 s.d. UC-05, overview)

|User|
start
:Buka halaman Detail Needlist\n(GET /needlist/{id}/show);

|System\n(NeedlistController::show)|
:Eager-load needlist beserta\ndetails, supplierInquiries.items,\npurchaseOrders, sawRekomendasi;
:Ambil referenceVariasiIds\n(item is_reference = true);
:Group semua SupplierInquiryItem\nberdasarkan id_barang (Master Barang)\n=> groupedItems;
:Ambil SawRekomendasi tersimpan\n(keyBy id_variasi);
:Render view needlist/show.blade\n(tab "Pemilihan Supplier");

|View (Blade/JS)|
:Sub-grouping per tier\n(OEM/Original/Aftermarket/KW)\n& kompatibilitas kendaraan;
:Tampilkan tabel penawaran\nharga per supplier per kluster;

|User|
if (Hitung rekomendasi SAW?) then (ya)
  :Klik tombol "Hitung SAW"\npada kluster tertentu;
  note right: lanjut ke diagram\nActivity Rekomendasi SAW (UC-03)
else (tidak)
endif

:Centang supplier pilihan\nuntuk setiap variasi;
:Klik tombol "Simpan Pilihan";
note right: lanjut ke diagram\nActivity Konfirmasi Supplier (UC-05)
stop
@enduml
